target
temp
.nightfall
configuration/toml.unwritable-*
**/*.log
.github
.vscode
.githooks
**/Dockerfile
docker-compose*
LICENSE
**/tests
.env.example
remappings.txt
**/*.ptau
nightfall_bindings/build.rs
# Client and proposer images copy proving_key only. Do not exclude the
# keys directory and then re-include it: that brings every key back into
# the build context
configuration/bin/keys/*
!configuration/bin/keys/proving_key
